WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.235 --> 00:00:16.416
Roxy rushed into Mrs.

2
00:00:16.456 --> 00:00:17.056
Bun's house.

3
00:00:18.637 --> 00:00:20.418
Mrs. Bun was hiding under a table.

4
00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:22.940
She peeked out at Roxy.

5
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.781
"They're upstairs," Mrs.

6
00:00:25.821 --> 00:00:26.422
Bun whispered.

7
00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:28.843
"The robbers?"

8
00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:29.864
asked Roxy.

9
00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:32.437
"They're not robbers."

10
00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.158
Mrs. Bun looked really scared.

11
00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:38.140
"They're bugs!"

12
00:00:40.321 --> 00:00:41.982
Roxy flew upstairs and gasped.

13
00:00:44.924 --> 00:00:46.044
Webs were everywhere.

14
00:00:48.646 --> 00:00:50.867
A giant centipede charged down the hallway.

15
00:00:51.808 --> 00:00:53.609
It knocked over furniture as it went by.

16
00:00:54.669 --> 00:00:56.610
A large bee flew behind the centipede.

17
00:00:57.511 --> 00:00:59.272
The bee was carrying a sack of money.

18
00:01:00.348 --> 00:01:02.049
A big spider ran along the ceiling.

19
00:01:03.669 --> 00:01:05.510
The bugs went out through an open window.

20
00:01:08.331 --> 00:01:10.312
Roxy ran to the window and looked down.

21
00:01:11.393 --> 00:01:12.553
A man stood in the yard.

22
00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:16.215
He wore big goggles and a helmet with two antennae.

23
00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:17.995
"Von Buzz!"

24
00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:18.976
thought Roxy.

25
00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:22.997
"Well done, pets," the villain told the bugs.

26
00:01:23.017 --> 00:01:25.819
"Now let's go!

27
00:01:26.579 --> 00:01:29.160
We have lots of houses to rob today!"

28
00:01:30.348 --> 00:01:31.509
"Stop right there!"

29
00:01:31.829 --> 00:01:32.550
yelled Roxy.

30
00:01:33.511 --> 00:01:34.852
She jumped down to the ground.

31
00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.754
Von Buzz spun around.

32
00:01:38.654 --> 00:01:40.456
His eyes went wide with surprise.

33
00:01:40.476 --> 00:01:42.397
"Rocket Girl!"

34
00:01:42.417 --> 00:01:46.520
"I'm not letting you steal that money," said Roxy.

35
00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.043
"Ha-ha!" Von Buzz laughed.

36
00:01:50.063 --> 00:01:52.785
"You can't stop me!

37
00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:56.368
I discovered a way to grow big bugs.

38
00:01:57.532 --> 00:02:01.175
Nobody will ever stop me from stealing again!"

39
00:02:01.195 --> 00:02:04.477
"I will stop you," said Roxy.

40
00:02:04.497 --> 00:02:07.279
"And then I'll take you back to jail."

41
00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.221
Von Buzz grinned.

42
00:02:10.442 --> 00:02:13.164
"Oh, I'm never going back to jail.

43
00:02:14.204 --> 00:02:15.525
It was an awful place."

44
00:02:17.287 --> 00:02:18.708
He touched the side of his helmet.

45
00:02:19.768 --> 00:02:21.249
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

46
00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.252
The big centipede charged toward Roxy.

47
00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.222
Its sharp claws snapped open and shut.

48
00:02:28.942 --> 00:02:30.043
Click! Click!

49
00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:34.767
Whiz-hoo! Roxy shot her eye laser beams.

50
00:02:35.648 --> 00:02:37.569
They blasted a small hole in the ground.

51
00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:39.991
The big centipede jumped back.

52
00:02:41.252 --> 00:02:43.194
The centipede looked nervously at Roxy.

53
00:02:45.296 --> 00:02:46.457
"Attack her!"

54
00:02:46.717 --> 00:02:47.678
Von Buzz said again.

55
00:02:48.758 --> 00:02:51.100
The centipede took a tiny step toward Roxy.

56
00:02:52.001 --> 00:02:55.484
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams again.

57
00:02:56.492 --> 00:02:58.274
The centipede jumped back once more.

58
00:02:59.275 --> 00:03:00.756
Then it curled up into a ball.

59
00:03:01.857 --> 00:03:03.158
Von Buzz stamped his foot.

60
00:03:03.178 --> 00:03:06.081
"Aargh!" "Ha!"

61
00:03:06.381 --> 00:03:07.102
Roxy laughed.

62
00:03:07.122 --> 00:03:10.525
"Your big centipede is afraid of me, Von Buzz!"

63
00:03:11.946 --> 00:03:13.287
Von Buzz ignored Roxy.

64
00:03:14.288 --> 00:03:15.870
He touched the side of his helmet again.

65
00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:18.172
"Attack Rocket Girl."

66
00:03:21.054 --> 00:03:22.536
The spider ran past Roxy.

67
00:03:23.464 --> 00:03:26.747
Roxy turned around and watched as it quickly spun a large web.

68
00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.009
Suddenly the bee crashed into her.

69
00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.551
Pow! "Oof!"

70
00:03:33.051 --> 00:03:33.772
cried Roxy.

71
00:03:34.733 --> 00:03:36.814
She flew through the air and landed on the web.

72
00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:40.997
Roxy tried to move, but the web was too sticky.

73
00:03:41.017 --> 00:03:42.638
"Oh no!"

74
00:03:43.019 --> 00:03:43.539
she cried.
